OL,3,ATrump arrives at high-speed IndyCar
OL,4,Arace through Washington's streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump was among
OL,7,Fhundreds of people who gathered to see
OL,8,Fthe IndyCar race through the streets of
OL,9,FWashington DC on Sunday, marking the
OL,10,Fculmination of a series of summer
OL,11,Fevents to celebrate the country's 250th
OL,12,Fbirthday.
OL,14,FThe president and First Lady Melania
OL,15,FTrump took a ceremonial lap of the
OL,16,F1.7-mile track in his presidential
OL,17,Flimousine, The Beast.
OL,19,FAs they reached the finish line,
OL,20,FTrump's new Air Force One completed a
OL,21,Fflyover above the capital.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
